  "solution": "Given: s _ r _ k s _ _ c k _ u r c _ s u _ c _\n\nBy checking options and substituting accordingly.\n\n1) c, u, c, r, s, k, r, k** → **s **__c__** r **__u__** k **/ **s **__c__** **__r__** c k **/ __s__** u r c **__k__** **/ **s u **__r__** c **__k__**\n\n**2) ****u, c, u, r, s, k, r, k** **→ **s **__u__** r **__c__** k **/** s **__u__** **__r__** c k **/ __s__** u r c **__k__** **/ **s u **__r__** c **__k__**\n\nHere \"s __u__ r __c__ k\" is repeating itself.\n\n**3) **c, u, c, s, r, k, s, k** →** s **__c__** r **__u__** k **/** s **__c__** **__s__** c k **/ __r__** u r c **__k__** **/ **s u **__s__** c **__k__**\n\n4) u, c, u, k, r, s, r, k → s **__u__** r **__c__** k **/** s **__u__** **__k__** c k **/ __r__** u r c **__s__** **/ **s u **__r__** c **__k__**\n\n \n• Option (2) gives a pattern of **s c r u k / **s c r c k** / s u r c k / **s u r c k**.**\n\nHence, **‘****u, c, u, r, s, k, r, k’** is the correct answer",
